y. Java 26 is quite new — should be fine with standard APIs.\n\nLet me create the files.","format":"unknown","index":0}]}},"id":"prt_eea2cc904001flSdx7V0pivgrk","sessionID":"ses_115d3aef6ffeMbIUsJnnq6Fzvd","messageID":"msg_eea2ca4f4001v1gSYY7Pp2p054"}}
