{"type":"text","timestamp":1782045434359,"sessionID":"ses_115d3aef6ffeMbIUsJnnq6Fzvd","part":{"id":"prt_eea2f55cf001h3wiRVK0rCRJkV","messageID":"msg_eea2f4f3a001zymrzEyqqyBPhp","sessionID":"ses_115d3aef6ffeMbIUsJnnq6Fzvd","type":"text","text":"Done. The Books REST API is implemented in Java with Maven, the JDK's built-in `com.sun.net.httpserver`, SQLite (via `sqlite-jdbc`), and Jackson for JSON.\n\n**Endpoints**: `GET /health`, `POST/GET /books` (with `?author=` filter), `GET/PUT/DELETE /books/{id}` — all return JSON with correct status codes (200/201/204/400/404/405/500). Validation rejects missing/blank `title` or `author` with 400.\n\n**Source files** (under `src/main/java/com/example/books/`): `Main.java`, `BookHandler.java`, `BookRepository.java`, `Book.java`, `HttpUtil.java`, `JsonUtil.java`, `HealthHandler.java`, `ValidationException.java`.\n\n**Tests** (`src/test/java/.../`): `BookApiIntegrationTest.java` (3 tests — health, full CRUD lifecycle, author filter + validation + 404) and `BookRepositoryTest.java` (2 tests — repository CRUD, author filter). **5/5 pass** via `mvn test`.\n\n**Run**: `mvn clean package` then `java -jar target/books-api-1.0.0.jar` (defaults to port 8080, `books.db`; configurable via `PORT` / `BOOKS_DB_PATH` env vars). Smoke-tested live: create/list/filter/validation/404 all behave correctly. README.md contains setup, endpoint reference, and curl examples.","time":{"start":1782045431247,"end":1782045434357}}}
